+
+## `GET /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Returns the current user's notification settings, including their email digest frequency.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "bundle_email_frequency": "weekly"
+}
+```
+
+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates the current user's notification settings. `bundle_email_frequency` must be one of `never`, `every_few_hours`, `daily`, or `weekly`.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
